<title>UK: London's Trocadero agrees Pepsi sponsorship.</title>
<headline>London's Trocadero agrees Pepsi sponsorship.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>London's Trocadero entertainment and shopping complex said on Monday it has signed a sponsorship deal with Pepsi worth up to three million stg.</p>
<p>It said it is to rename the Trocadero complex at Piccadilly &quot;Pepsi Trocadero&quot;.</p>
<p>The Trocadero complex was relaunched earlier this month after a 50 million stg redevelopment expected to triple revenues over five years.</p>
<p>The Pepsi sponsorship deal will last two years.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
